/-!
# Milne, Class Field Theory, Lemma II.2.6

For a group `G`, let `I_G` be the augmentation ideal in the integral group ring.  The map

`g ↦ (g - 1) mod I_G²`

induces an isomorphism from the abelianization of `G` to `I_G / I_G²`.
