the twisted action is

`σ * (0, τ - 1) = (φ(σ, τ), στ - σ)`.

This is Milne's formula `σ x_τ = x_(στ) - x_σ + φ(σ,τ)`.  We prove directly
from the cocycle identity that it defines a representation, and construct the
short exact sequence `0 -> C -> C(φ) -> I_G -> 0`.
